Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 05:17:26 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] Bot Control B2: bots:command channel

Sends one playerbot command through mod-wowmin-telemetry's
"wowmin botcmd <bot> <command>" over the existing SOAP client and
returns the parsed WBOTCMD reply. A TypeScript mirror of the module
allowlist (scope A3) and a letters-only 2-12 bot name guard refuse
locally what the server would refuse; the server stays the real check.
Every sent command is logged to bot-commands.jsonl in the data dir
(time, bot, command, reply, source).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
